Third-party material
--------------------

The rule catalogs of the go-style skill (skills/go-style/rules/ in the go-style
plugin; plugins/go-style/skills/go-style/rules/ in the repository) are adapted
from the style guides listed below, and their _anchors.tsv files list the
guides' section headings. The material has been changed: guide sections are
split into separate rules, summarized and paraphrased, and extended with
severities, linter mappings, review hints, exceptions and examples. The skill
instructions and the documentation also name guide sections and quote short
passages. Every rule links to the original section.

The authors of these guides do not sponsor or endorse this project.

